sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant p0 as Cashier
    participant p1 as POS App
    participant p2 as Local Journal
    participant p3 as Sync Gateway
    participant p4 as Sales DB
    participant p5 as Reconcile Worker
    p0->>p1: Create sale while offline
    p1->>p2: Write immutable local operation
    p1->>p0: Provisional local receipt
    p1->>p3: Reconnect and upload batch
    p3->>p4: Dedup by operation UUID
    p4->>p3: Committed server version
    p3->>p1: Sync acknowledgement and conflicts
    p4->>p5: Investigate conflicting receipts
